{
  "name": "dsh-comic-story-video",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "漫画故事片场：随包提供「漫画面讲故事」skill（声音是主线的十条硬规则+八格范例），把选题做成 110–135 秒竖屏漫画短视频——线稿逐笔描出、代码叠台词气泡、单口配音、大字幕。Python 逐笔引擎（whiteboard-animator）随包携带，工具层编排：预检（comic_check，只拦机械事故）、出图清单（comic_prompts，指纹台账防重复花钱）、后台制作（comic_produce）、产物校验（comic_verify，抽帧+听音）、环境体检（comic_doctor，可自动补依赖）。侧栏「漫画故事片场」工作台：四步流水线视图 + 分镜档案 + 成片播放。",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "engine",
    "lab",
    "lib",
    "skills",
    "locale/*.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "comic",
    "storyboard",
    "whiteboard",
    "lineart",
    "tts",
    "short-video",
    "explainer"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2 <0.3.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
